From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Orchard migration <noreply@orchardlinux>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:31:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] PCI: apple-h9p: Parse manual-availability DART with a fixed
 stream cell

apple,manual-availability-iommu names a DART and the stream whose retained
configuration is reloaded during link bring-up. The driver parsed it with
the DART's #iommu-cells and then required exactly one argument, so the
property broke as soon as the DART used the standard five-cell specifier
that carries the DMA window.

The property only ever carries the stream ID. Parse it with one fixed
argument cell and describe the cells in the binding.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,t8010-pcie.yaml     |  5 ++++-
 drivers/pci/controller/pcie-apple-h9p.c               | 11 +++--------
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,t8010-pcie.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,t8010-pcie.yaml
index ee357b24d..0e1cc7b0b 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,t8010-pcie.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,t8010-pcie.yaml
@@ -144,7 +144,10 @@ patternProperties:
 
       apple,manual-availability-iommu:
         $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle-array
-        maxItems: 1
+        items:
+          - items:
+              - description: phandle of the DART
+              - description: stream ID
         description:
           DART and stream whose retained configuration must be reloaded while
           this root port is brought up. This models Apple's manual-availability
diff --git a/drivers/pci/controller/pcie-apple-h9p.c b/drivers/pci/controller/pcie-apple-h9p.c
index 0da07dfeb..59bb4d22a 100644
--- a/drivers/pci/controller/pcie-apple-h9p.c
+++ b/drivers/pci/controller/pcie-apple-h9p.c
@@ -1867,15 +1867,10 @@ static int apple_h9p_pcie_parse_ports(struct apple_h9p_pcie *pcie)
 		{
 			struct of_phandle_args dart;
 
-			ret = of_parse_phandle_with_args(np,
-							 "apple,manual-availability-iommu",
-							 "#iommu-cells", 0, &dart);
+			ret = of_parse_phandle_with_fixed_args(np,
+							       "apple,manual-availability-iommu",
+							       1, 0, &dart);
 			if (!ret) {
-				if (dart.args_count != 1) {
-					of_node_put(dart.np);
-					ret = -EINVAL;
-					goto out_put_child;
-				}
 				pcie->manual_dart[port] = dart.np;
 				pcie->manual_dart_sid[port] = dart.args[0];
 			} else if (ret != -ENOENT) {
